  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know, contrapositive of <math><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></math> is <math><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>p</mi></math><br />Hence, required contrapositive statement is &ldquo;If you are not a citizen of India, then you are not born in India&rdquo;.",
